 41	    /**
 42	     * Create a new animal with given specifications. An animal can be created with random age (or start at age 0) and
 43	     * with a random foodLevel.
 44	     *
 45	     * @param field (Field) the field where the simulation takes place
 46	     * @param location (Location) the Location at which the animal should appear
 47	     * @param name (String) the animal's name (its species' name)
 48	     * @param maximumTemperature (int) the maximum temperature the animal can survive to
 49	     * @param minimumTemperature (int) the minimum temperature an animal can survive to
