 51	     * @param reproductionProbability (double) the probability that the animal reproduces at each step after a given minimum breeding age
 52	     * @param maxAge (int) the animal's life expectancy
 53	     * @param breedingAge (int) the age at which animal can start to reproduce
 54	     * @param maxLitterSize (int) the maximum number of children the animal can have in one reproduction
 55	     * @param randomAge (boolean) whether an animal should be created with a random age
